<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">oObject<dd>target Object<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">sTag<dd>Tag for the objects to query<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">nIncludeSelf<dd>TRUE if the query should check the target object
